{"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"PlanarEmbedding","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"PlanarEmbedding"}],"modules":[{"name":"Planarity"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","symbolKind":"struct","title":"PlanarEmbedding","remoteSource":{"fileName":"PlanarEmbedding.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding.swift#L66"},"externalID":"s:9Planarity15PlanarEmbeddingV"},"topicSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/ClockwiseIncidentEdges","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/ClockwiseNeighborIndices","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/ClockwiseNeighbors","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/Faces-swift.struct"],"title":"Structures","anchor":"Structures"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/faceCount","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/faces-swift.property"],"title":"Instance Properties","anchor":"Instance-Properties"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseIncidentEdges(checked:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseIncidentEdges(of:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseNeighborIndices(ofIndex:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseNeighbors(checked:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseNeighbors(of:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/dualGraph()","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/face(checkedFrom:alongEdgeAt:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/face(from:alongEdgeAt:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/rightFace(checkedFrom:alongEdgeAt:)","doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/rightFace(from:alongEdgeAt:)"],"title":"Instance Methods","anchor":"Instance-Methods"},{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/CustomStringConvertible-Implementations"],"title":"Default Implementations","anchor":"Default-Implementations"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity"]]},"relationshipsSections":[{"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Planarity\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/Planarity\/s23CustomStringConvertibleP","doc:\/\/Planarity\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/Planarity\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/Planarity\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"title":"Conforms To"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/planarity\/planarembedding"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A planar embedding of a graph: a rotation system, the clockwise order of the edges around each"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertex, over every edge position. Its faces satisfy Euler’s formula, n − m + f = 2, in every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"connected component with an edge."}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@frozen"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"PlanarEmbedding"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":"> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"where"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P","identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Graph"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A self-loop appears twice in its vertex’s order, its two ends adjacent, enclosing a face of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"length 1. Parallel copies sit side by side, each consecutive pair enclosing a face of length 2."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Each clockwise order starts at the first edge of "},{"code":"incidentEdges(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Faces.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" The face after the half-edge from u along edge e to w continues with the half-edge"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"before e in the clockwise order at w, so a face lies to the right of each of its half-edges."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Faces are counted per connected component, and an isolated vertex has none: two disjoint"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"triangles have four faces."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The embedding keeps the graph it was made from (copy-on-write, so O(1)); mutating the graph","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"afterwards does not change it. When a graph has several embeddings, which one is returned is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not specified, but it depends only on the graph’s rows: graphs with the same vertices, the same","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"edge positions and the same incidence order get the same embedding.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://Planarity/documentation/Planarity/PlanarEmbedding/clockwiseIncidentEdges(checked:)":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"clockwiseIncidentEdges"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"checked"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols14VertexNotFoundV","text":"VertexNotFound"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:9Planarity15PlanarEmbeddingV","text":"PlanarEmbedding"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":">."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:9Planarity15PlanarEmbeddingV22ClockwiseIncidentEdgesV","text":"ClockwiseIncidentEdges"}],"abstract":[{"code":"clockwiseIncidentEdges(of:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", throwing instead of trapping when "},{"code":"vertex","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is not a vertex"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the graph."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/clockwiseIncidentEdges(checked:)","title":"clockwiseIncidentEdges(checked:)","url":"\/documentation\/planarity\/planarembedding\/clockwiseincidentedges(checked:)"},"doc://Planarity/documentation/Planarity":{"title":"Planarity","abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity","role":"collection","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/planarity"},"doc://Planarity/documentation/Planarity/PlanarEmbedding/faces-swift.property":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/faces-swift.property","title":"faces","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"faces"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:9Planarity15PlanarEmbeddingV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"PlanarEmbedding"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"G"},{"kind":"text","text":">."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:9Planarity15PlanarEmbeddingV5FacesV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Faces"}],"url":"\/documentation\/planarity\/planarembedding\/faces-swift.property","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The faces, each a closed walk along the half-edges with the face on their right, in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order a walk of the vertices in order, and of each clockwise order in order, first reaches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them; each starts at the tail of that first half-edge. Every edge position is on two sides"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of faces, once on each, or twice on one face (a bridge)."}]},"doc://Planarity/documentation/Planarity/PlanarEmbedding/ClockwiseNeighborIndices":{"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ClockwiseNeighborIndices"}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/planarity\/planarembedding\/clockwiseneighborindices","identifier":"doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/ClockwiseNeighborIndices","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ClockwiseNeighborIndices"}],"title":"PlanarEmbedding.ClockwiseNeighborIndices","abstract":[{"text":"The numbers of the vertices across the edges at a vertex, in clockwise order.","type":"text"}]},"doc://Planarity/documentation/Planarity/PlanarEmbedding/rightFace(checkedFrom:alongEdgeAt:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Planarity\/documentation\/Planarity\/PlanarEmbedding\/rightFace(checkedFrom:alongEdgeAt:)","title":"rightFace(checkedFrom:alongEdgeAt:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments